{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quase Rosa features basic mechanics: <strong>double jump</strong>, <strong>dash</strong> and <strong>ston</strong>e. However, each time you try to pass a level, only one different skill is possible. In other words, if you die or restart the level, you'll have a 33% chance of picking up any of the three skills at random, which may or may not make it easier to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a system of <strong>Percentage Cards</strong>, where you can increase the probability of playing with a desired skill. The player can choose between 50%, 75% and 100% cards and then select which skill they want to use the card for.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861820?t=1756748520","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861820/a1e644eb62217024d26e9871e9a3b18f0aa98874/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756748520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861820/63a111a1bd1d184486f3a22ac13aba9c859905b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756748520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861820/63a111a1bd1d184486f3a22ac13aba9c859905b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756748520","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3973420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quase Rosa features basic mechanics: <strong>double jump</strong>, <strong>dash</strong> and <strong>ston</strong>e. However, each time you try to pass a level, only one different skill is possible. In other words, if you die or restart the level, you'll have a 33% chance of picking up any of the three skills at random, which may or may not make it easier to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a system of <strong>Percentage Cards</strong>, where you can increase the probability of playing with a desired skill. The player can choose between 50%, 75% and 100% cards and then select which skill they want to use the card for.</p>","developers":["Ygapu K."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861820/1a83034c64905a78dff667b884186cbb9ef2ded4/header.jpg?t=1756748520","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Debian 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3 compatible card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257185835,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185835/movie480.mp4?t=1755699409","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185835/movie_max.mp4?t=1755699409"},"name":"Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185835/1a427188a08d904cd08e0a1a14de69a90e6ec976/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755699409","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185835/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755699409","max":"http://video.akamai.ste